        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the wilderness, far from the nearest town, Ethan and his loyal dog, Ranger, set out on what should have been a simple hunting trip. The forest seems calm at first — birds singing, the crunch of dry leaves underfoot, the familiar weight of the rifle in Ethan’s hands. But as the sun dips below the treeline, an eerie stillness begins to creep in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172680/extras/d6de9968bcd66643eb5fa18414ca8541.poster.avif?t=1764436438\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172680/extras/d6de9968bcd66643eb5fa18414ca8541.webm?t=1764436438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172680/extras/d6de9968bcd66643eb5fa18414ca8541.mp4?t=1764436438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was meant to be a quiet day in nature slowly turns into something far darker. Strange sounds echo between the trees. Shadows move where there should be none. Ranger starts growling at the empty air, and Ethan begins to feel that something — or someone — is watching them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night falls, the forest reveals its true nature. There are stories about this valley — tales of hunters who never returned, and of a creature that wears the skin of its victims. Now, Ethan will have to face the ancient horror that lurks among the pines, and uncover the mystery of what really lives in these woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skinwalker’s Valley</strong> combines atmospheric storytelling, exploration, and psychological terror. You’ll need to rely on light, sound, and your instincts to survive. Every step deeper into the forest leads you closer to the truth — and to something that should never have been found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it out before the darkness claims you too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse and detailed locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiceover for the main character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot a gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality cutscenes</p></li></ul>",
